T*
(### A. Weak Content-Security-Policy \(Medium Severity\)) Tj
T*
(*   **Issue:** The CSP header contains permissive directives \(`'unsafe-inline'`, `'unsafe-eval'`\) ) Tj
T*
(and broad source lists.) Tj
