T*
(## 10. Coverage and Limitations) Tj
T*
(*   **SQL Injection:** This module was skipped because the Reconnaissance phase did not identify any) Tj
T*
( user-supplied input parameters. Automated scanners cannot test SQLi without a known injection point) Tj
T*
( \(e.g., `?id=1` or login forms\). Manual testing is required to discover these vectors.) Tj
T*
(*   **XSS Scope:** Limited to reflected XSS on discovered links and static content. Stored XSS ) Tj
T*
(requires interaction with dynamic form submissions, which were not explicitly targeted in this ) Tj
T*
(scan's payload generation phase due to the lack of input parameters found during Recon.) Tj
T*
(*   **Cloudflare Proxying:** The target is served via Cloudflare proxies \(ports 80/443\). This masks ) Tj
T*
(the origin server details and may prevent direct connection attempts that some scanners require for ) Tj
T*
(deep protocol analysis.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
